lor\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Automatically cuts wood into smaller pieces (can harm player if touched while enabled)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">???</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The bandsaw is an item purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a> for <b>$<s>35,000</s>  $10,000</b>. It can automatically cut planks, and be resized to fit larger or smaller trees - with maximum size of 20x20. Much like other machines, it can be moved around in the Property Management menu. When turned on, the Bandsaw will make several cuts into the wood (or player, if you stand in its way, which deal about 20 hp/s) until the wood is removed or the bandsaw is turned off. Bandsaw's damage is fairly weak compared to a normal axe, making chopping huge wood like Sequoia relatively slow. Consider buying multiple bandsaw in a row to make efficiency in time.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831182049\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 550/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive 